{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "stereo",
 "version": "0.12",
 "title": "Stereo samples",
 "description": "Stereo WAVs upload through Transfer as stereo and play in stereo through the filter, the amp and the pan. CONFIG > Mods > Upload: ST, or MON as stock. Track Setup ([FUNC] + [TRACK]) > Chan: ST or MONO (the track's stereo samples as their mono mix), kept with the sound. The sample browser plays a sample already loaded into the project from its own copy, whole",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "drumkilla",
 "license": "MIT",
